#: title
msgid "Workstation Community"
msgstr ""

#: description
msgid ""
"Join a community of users and contributors focused on Fedora Workstation."
msgstr ""

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Etext
msgid ""
"Fedora Workstation is created by a team in the Fedora Project community "
"called the Workstation Working Group. It is comprised of official members "
"who have decision-making powers, as well as other contributors. Learn more "
"about this group and how you can get involved on the Workstation Working "
"Group website."
msgstr ""

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Ecard-%3E[0]-%3Etitle
msgid "Forum"
msgstr ""

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Ecard-%3E[0]-%3Ecta-%3Etext
msgid ""
"The Fedora Workstation tag on Fedora's Discourse-based discussion forum is a "
"great place to connect with other Fedora Workstation users and contributors."
msgstr ""
